========================================================================================
GATE 4.6 -- FOCUS-STEP sensitivity of the matched-filter factor at 0.25 cyc/px
  (must be aperture-invariant, so it cancels in the f/5.6 : f/11 ratio -- check)
========================================================================================
  step px      K=41      K=81     K=113
     0.25    4.1090    4.1445    4.1515
     0.50    2.9309    2.9384    2.9393
     1.00    2.0778    2.0788    2.0790
     2.00    1.4699    1.4701    1.4702
     4.00    1.0395    1.0396    1.0396
  The factor depends strongly on the step but not on K once K*step is large,
  so it cancels exactly in an aperture ratio taken at matched blur-per-step.
  The 13.5x therefore does NOT depend on the step choice; only the 2.08 does.

